<BODY>
<!-- Converted from text/plain format -->

<P><FONT SIZE=2>[Attachment contains OUO]<BR>
<BR>
Dr. Juzaitis:<BR>
<BR>
Please find attached the Investigation Report that is being issued by the Office of Enterprise Assessments' Office of Enforcement to National Security Technologies, LLC regarding the June 13, 2014, chemical explosion that injured two workers at the Nevada National Security Site&#8217;s Nonproliferation Test and Evaluation Complex.<BR>
<BR>
[The attached document is sensitive and marked as Official Use Only (OUO); a second e-mail will follow that will allow you to open the document.]<BR>
<BR>
Hard copies to follow via U.S. Mail for:<BR>
<BR>
Dr. Raymond Juzaitis<BR>
Steven Lawrence<BR>
Brian Barbero<BR>
Richard Reback<BR>
<BR>
If you have any questions regarding the content of the report, please contact Kevin Dressman, Director, Office of Worker Safety and Health Enforcement, at (301) 903-0100.<BR>
<BR>
<BR>
Steven C. Simonson<BR>
Director<BR>
Office of Enforcement<BR>
Office of Enterprise Assessments<BR>
U.S. Department of Energy<BR>
(301) 903-7707<BR>
<BR>
<BR>
